---
description: HTTP presentation conventions for Next Route Handlers
globs: src/app/api/**/*.ts,src/modules/**/presentation/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Presentation HTTP

- Response wrap: `{ result: T }` / `{ result: null, error: { statusCode, message, code? } }`
- Use `jsonResult` / `handleRouteError` / `requireBearerUser` from `@shared/presentation/http`
- Zod schemas co-located under feature `presentation/http/validation/schemas`
- API paths under `/api/v1/...`
